Step 1: Design (RTL)

Create rtl/siso.v

module siso(
    input clk,
    input rst,
    input serial_in,
    output serial_out
);

reg [3:0] shift_reg;

always @(posedge clk or posedge rst)
begin
    if(rst)
        shift_reg <= 4'b0000;
    else
        shift_reg <= {shift_reg[2:0], serial_in};
end

assign serial_out = shift_reg[3];

endmodule
Function
4-bit Serial-In Serial-Out shift register.
On every rising clock edge:
Existing bits shift left.
New bit enters at LSB.
MSB becomes the serial output.
Reset clears the register.
